# Pattern Catalog: fabiosouzadev/dotfiles

Extracted during Loop Engineering analysis (2026-08-03). Each pattern labeled FACT (direct evidence) or INFERENCE (reasoned).

---

## Structural Patterns

| Pattern | Location | Label | Notes |
|---------|----------|-------|-------|
| Source dir = `home/` | `.chezmoiroot` contains `home` | FACT | Non-standard (default is `.`) |
| Config template = `.chezmoi.yaml.tmpl` | Root of source dir | FACT | Generates `~/.config/chezmoi/chezmoi.yaml` |
| Ignore template = `.chezmoiignore.tmpl` | Root of source dir | FACT | Conditional by `.settings` |
| Data dir = `.chezmoidata/` | `home/.chezmoidata/` | FACT | Per-OS + global YAML |
| Scripts dir = `.chezmoiscripts/` | `home/.chezmoiscripts/` | FACT | Per-OS + `unix/` + `vps/` |
| Templates dir = `.chezmoitemplates/` | `home/.chezmoitemplates/` | FACT | `common/` + OS + `workplace/` |
| Zsh modules dir = `dot_zshrc.d/` | `home/dot_zshrc.d/` | FACT | Numbered 099-999, sourced in order |
| Encrypted configs prefix = `private_` | `home/private_dot_*/` | FACT | Decrypted via age on apply |
| GPG secrets = `encrypted_*.asc` | `home/encrypted_*.zsh.asc` | FACT | Sourced in Zsh modules |
| Docs dir = `docs/` | Root | FACT | Generated by `gsd-doc-writer` |
| Planning dir = `.planning/` | Root | FACT | GSD methodology artifacts |

