## Naming Convention Patterns

| Pattern | Example | Label | Notes |
|---------|---------|-------|-------|
| Lifecycle scripts: `run_once_before_XXX` | `run_once_before_216-install-wm.sh.tmpl` | FACT | Pre-install, ordered by number |
| Lifecycle scripts: `run_once_after_XXX` | `run_once_after_590-install-ai-tools.sh.tmpl` | FACT | Post-install, ordered by number |
| Lifecycle scripts: `run_onchange_after_XXX` | `run_onchange_after_605-clone-my-repos.sh.tmpl` | FACT | Re-runnable on template change |
| Template guards: `script_is_not_*` | `script_is_not_ephemeral`, `script_is_not_headless` | FACT | Exit 0 if condition met |
| Feature flags: `features.<domain>.<feature>` | `features.ai.hermes.dashboard.enabled` | FACT | Hierarchical, ternary defaults |
| Profile detection: `$profile` variable | `personal` \| `work` \| `vps` | FACT | Set in `.chezmoi.yaml.tmpl` |
| Environment flags: `$ephemeral`, `$headless`, `$guiAvailable` | Set in `.chezmoi.yaml.tmpl` | FACT | Control script execution |
| Workspace bases: `BASE_PERSONAL`, `BASE_WORK`, `BASE_OTHER` | Clone script variables | FACT | `~/Workspaces/{Personal,Work,Others}` |

