## Template Patterns

| Pattern | Example | Label | Notes |
|---------|---------|-------|-------|
| Guard template inclusion | `{{ template "common/script_is_not_ephemeral" . }}` | FACT | At top of lifecycle scripts |
| Helper template inclusion | `{{ template "common/script_helper" . }}` | FACT | Provides `info/warn/error/success` |
| Mise eval template | `{{ template "common/script_eval_mise" . }}` | FACT | Activates mise in bash |
| Conditional ignore | `{{ if .settings.vps }} ... {{ end }}` | FACT | In `.chezmoiignore.tmpl` |
| Feature flag gating | `{{ if .features.ai.hermes.dashboard.enabled }}` | FACT | In scripts and templates |
| Ternary for complex logic | `{{ ternary true false condition }}` | FACT | Used for `$guiAvailable` |
| Range loops over data | `{{ range .ai_tools.npm }}` | FACT | In `run_once_after_590-install-ai-tools.sh.tmpl` |
| Data consolidation | `data: {{ $data \| toYaml \| indent 2 }}` | FACT | At end of `.chezmoi.yaml.tmpl` |

