## Script Patterns

| Pattern | Example | Label | Notes |
|---------|---------|-------|-------|
| Idempotent install check | `if ! command -v "tool" > /dev/null; then install; fi` | FACT | In universal binary scripts |
| OS-specific package install | `if eq .chezmoi.os "linux" ...` | FACT | In clone script for git/jq |
| Feature flag + block check | `$featureEnabled` + `$blocked` variables | FACT | In AI tools install script |
| Completion generation | `completions_cmd > ~/.local/share/zsh/site-functions/_tool` | FACT | For npm tools with `completions_cmd` |
| Workspace mkdir before clone | `mkdir -p "$BASE_PERSONAL"` | FACT | In clone script |
| Workplace-specific clone | `if eq $workplaceName "Zup"` | FACT | Only for work profile + Zup workplace |

