## Philosophical / Inferred Patterns

| Pattern | Evidence | Label | Notes |
|---------|----------|-------|-------|
| Reproducibility > convenience | README, ARCHITECTURE.md | INFERENCE | Bootstrap in 1 command, auto-detection |
| IA as first-class citizen | AI tools in bootstrap, dedicated scripts | INFERENCE | Hermes, OmniRoute, Coding Orchestrator |
| Universal binary over package manager | ARCHITECTURE.md section | INFERENCE | For tools not in apt, no sudo, cross-platform |
| Zinit preferred over Oh My Zsh | Only Zinit found in repo | INFERENCE | Could be historical |
| Aider as default coding agent | README "Aider (padrão, via OmniRoute)" | INFERENCE | Others configurable |
| Worktree isolation for coding | README "Worktree Isolation" | INFERENCE | Git worktrees per task |
| Selective backup over full | HERMES-BACKUP.md, OMNIROUTE-BACKUP.md | INFERENCE | "Not history, identity/config" |
| Modular over monolithic | dot_zshrc.d, separate data/scripts/templates | INFERENCE | Clear separation of concerns |
| Idempotency mandatory | All scripts check before install | INFERENCE | Re-runnable safely |
| Security by default | age + GPG, private_ prefix, encrypted_ prefix | INFERENCE | No plaintext secrets in Git |

