## Anti-Patterns (Things NOT Done)

| Anti-Pattern | Evidence | Label |
|--------------|----------|-------|
| No monolithic backup tarballs | HERMES-BACKUP.md explicitly forbids | FACT |
| No unencrypted secrets in Git | All secrets via age/GPG | FACT |
| No hardcoded paths (mostly) | Uses `.chezmoi.homeDir`, `joinPath` | FACT |
| No manual steps in bootstrap | Everything in scripts/templates | FACT |
| No untracked runtime state in repo | Logs, caches, DBs excluded | FACT |
| No single-profile assumption | personal/work/vps all supported | FACT |